--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b3f2a8c8f344355b16a4d4296ae3f98, type: 3}
  m_Name: Serpent
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  vesselClass: 7
  entries:
  - Element: 1
    AbilityLabel: Sniper Shot
    AbilityDescription: 'Scoped, the right trigger fires a single hitscan round down the scope''s
      own line that destroys what it hits - including SUPER-SHIELDED mass, which only the
      Rhino''s energised blade could touch before. Charge sets the RECOVERY: the wait between
      shots, 12s at rest down to 5.4s at Charge 10. The shot spends no resource and carries no
      ammunition, so the cooldown IS its whole cost.'
    Input: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Pierce
    UpgradeDescription: 'The round no longer stops at the first prism - it carries through up
      to three, super-shielded or not, in one shot. Gated on the REPLICATED unlock bit rather
      than a local level read, because it decides how much mass dies and every peer has to
      agree.'
  - Element: 2
    AbilityLabel: (open design slot)
    AbilityDescription: Mass mapping not yet designed for the Serpent.
    Input: 0
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 
  - Element: 3
    AbilityLabel: Scope
    AbilityDescription: 'Hold the left trigger and a magnified view down your own nose opens in
      a round eyepiece beside the flight view - the ship keeps flying exactly as it did - while
      the right trigger becomes the Sniper Shot. The zoom is the trigger''s own depth and nothing
      else: an analog dial, not a toggle. Space sets the MAGNIFICATION: 22 degrees of field of
      view at full zoom at rest, narrowing to 11 at Space 10, floored at 8 so the scope can never
      become a soda straw. Reach is Space''s job fleet-wide and a scope''s whole claim is reach.'
    Input: 2
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Deep Focus
    UpgradeDescription: 'One more magnification step. Deep Focus multiplies the scope''s zoom
      depth by 1.6 and divides its floor by the same number, so the extra reach is actually
      reachable instead of running into a ceiling the upgrade cannot pass - 22 degrees at full
      zoom at rest becomes 13.8, and Space 10 reaches 6.9.'
  - Element: 4
    AbilityLabel: Boost Duration
    AbilityDescription: 'Time extends the boost DURATION only
      (ConsumeBoostActionSO.timeDurationMultiplier, x1 at rest to x1.6 at Time 10, floored
      at x0.25). Until the element-scaling unification a fleet-wide read in
      VesselTransformer.CurrentBoostAmount also applied Time to the boost''s SPEED, which
      this map declared nowhere; speed is now per-hull through the prefab''s own
      BoostSpeedMultiplier, which the Serpent does not author (so x1, unscaled).'
    Input: 6
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 
